格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Import conversation history from 25+ AI coding agents into DeepSeek Harness as resumable sessions — tool calls, reasoning and results kept intact, with reverse export and sync. | 把 25+ AI 编程 Agent 的聊天记录导入 DeepSeek Harness 继续对话，保留工具调用、推理与结果，支持反向导出与同步。","id":"gh:1333200468","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-chat-import","slug":"Nwflower/dsh-chat-import","topics":["agent","ai-agents","automation","chatgpt","claude-code","codex","cursor","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","gemini","import","jsonl","migration","openai","plugin","sessions","transcript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Import conversation history from 25+ AI coding agents into DeepSeek Harness as resumable sessions — "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"tool calls, reasoning and results kept intact, with reverse export and sync. | 把 25+ AI 编程 Agent 的聊天"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"记录导入 DeepSeek Harness 继续对话，保留工具调用、推理与结果，支持反向导出与同步。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Chat Import"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A session import plugin built on DeepSeek Harness: import conversation history from other agents w"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ith one click, then keep talking in DeepSeek Harness.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **All sessions, continued in DSH.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[](README.md) [](README.zh-CN.md)"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Supported Data Sources"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Claude Code"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Codex"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Gemini CLI"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Goose"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Crush"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Qoder CLI"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Kimi CLI"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Kimi Code"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Reasonix"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"OpenCode"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"MiMo Code"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"ZCode"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Grok Build"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"OpenClaw"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Kilo Code"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Pi Coding Agent"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"oh-my-pi"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Hermes"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Cursor"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Cline"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Continue"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Zed"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Antigravity"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"ChatGPT"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"WorkBuddy"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Qwen"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"DSH"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"TeleAgent"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Trae Work"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Doubao"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Mistral Vibe"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"CodeArts Desktop"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"CodeBuddy Code"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Local JSONL"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Copilot VS Code"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Copilot CLI"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"> Requires dsh 0.1.5-rc.1 or newer. Verified on the 0.1.x line and on the 0.2.x line; dsh-tools must"},{"id":"p44s2","text":" satisfy `>=0.1.0-rc.6 <0.3.0`."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"1. Install from a terminal"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"2. Or install from the Plugin Marketplace"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"1. Import conversations from the GUI"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"Click the **Import sessions** button at the bottom of the left sidebar to open the import window. Wi"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"th the DSH Claude Style theme, that button lives in the account menu at the bottom left. Pick the co"},{"id":"p50s3","text":"nversations you want and import them in one click."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"Rows carry their own tools: **double-click** a row to preview the conversation (a read-only dry-run "},{"id":"p51s2","text":"— plugin injections skipped, tool calls folded into one line), switch the search box to **In content"},{"id":"p51s3","text":"** to search message bodies instead of titles, **hide** a row reversibly, move a single-session sour"},{"id":"p51s4","text":"ce file to the Recycle Bin, or **drag the row onto a workspace** in the left sidebar to import it th"},{"id":"p51s5","text":"ere with its timestamps shifted so it sorts to the top. The exact rules are in docs/USAGE.md."},{"id":"p52s1","text":"If the file came from somewhere else — a web-app export, a script you wrote, a tool this plugin does"},{"id":"p52s2","text":" not list — use **Import from file** at the top of the same window. Type a local path and press Ente"},{"id":"p52s3","text":"r, or press **Choose…** to pick files. When the path is a directory, it asks whether to search subfo"},{"id":"p52s4","text":"lders. Check the preview, then import. If detection fails, it lists why each candidate parser gave u"},{"id":"p52s5","text":"p and points you at the skill that converts the format."},{"id":"p53s1","text":"> These screenshots also use the DeepSeek palette from DSH Claude Style, another theme plugin by the"},{"id":"p53s2","text":" same author. It recreates the look and feel of Claude Code Desktop inside DSH and ships two palette"},{"id":"p53s3","text":"s, one for Claude and one for DeepSeek. If the default theme is not quite your taste, give it a try."},{"id":"p53s4","text":" The workspaces and sessions in the screenshots are sample data."},{"id":"p54s1","text":"2. Import through an agent's tool call"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"Cursor workspace grouping and imports prefer the local Cursor workspace registry by conversation id,"},{"id":"p56s2","text":" accepting only existing directories. Imports always read fresh; discovery caches successful reads a"},{"id":"p56s3","text":"nd invalidates on DB/WAL changes. Malformed JSON and filesystem failures are counted in diagnostic w"},{"id":"p56s4","text":"arnings. When no usable entry exists, they fall back to decoding the transcript's project directory "},{"id":"p56s5","text":"gs. When no usable entry exists, they fall back to decoding the transcript's project directory name."},{"id":"p57s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"To accommodate TUI users, the tools this plugin provides start out injected into context. In Setting"},{"id":"p58s2","text":"s you can switch them to **not injected**, or to a partial injection, which saves a fair number of t"},{"id":"p58s3","text":"can switch them to **not injected**, or to a partial injection, which saves a fair number of tokens."},{"id":"p59s1","text":"Full tool and command usage is in **docs/USAGE.md**."},{"id":"p60s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p61s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p62s1","text":"| Capability | Entry Point | Description |"},{"id":"p63s1","text":"| Import | Sidebar panel, \"Import\" tab | Import conversations from other agents, keeping reasoning, "},{"id":"p63s2","text":"tool call results, and system prompts (optional) |\n| Import from file | Panel \"Import from file\" / `"},{"id":"p63s3","text":"/import auto <path>` | Any local file or directory: three-level detection (explicit format > content"},{"id":"p63s4","text":" marker > parser trial), preview first, an optional search-subfolders prompt for directories, and, w"},{"id":"p63s5","text":"hen every parser fails, a ready-to-send agent task brief plus a registered `dsh-chat-import-convert`"},{"id":"p63s6","text":" skill |\n| Retract Import | Sidebar panel, \"History\" tab | Review import history and delete sessions"},{"id":"p63s7","text":" this plugin created |\n| Export | Context tool | Serialize DSH sessions back into other agents' form"},{"id":"p63s8","text":"ats |\n| Ignore | Automatic, plus `/ignores` | Archiving, deleting, or removing a workspace registers"},{"id":"p63s9","text":" the source, so rescans skip it; `/ignore` and `/unignore` manage the table |"},{"id":"p64s1","text":"Codex discovery prefers the session title saved in `session_index.jsonl` (`thread_name`), so a renam"},{"id":"p64s2","text":"e made in Codex still shows up. Only when no indexed title exists does it fall back to the first rea"},{"id":"p64s3","text":"l user prompt, extracted the same way import does it, with injected page context excluded. The title"},{"id":"p64s4","text":" index is streamed line by line, and the last valid title record wins for each session."},{"id":"p65s1","text":"For activity time, Codex discovery takes the latest valid timestamp found within bounded head and ta"},{"id":"p65s2","text":"il windows of the transcript and combines the results across rollout pages. File modification time i"},{"id":"p65s3","text":"s the fallback when the transcript carries no timestamp at all, so activity times still come back wh"},{"id":"p65s4","text":"en the host file service does not expose modification times. A timestamp inside a truncated record c"},{"id":"p65s5","text":"ile service does not expose modification times. A timestamp inside a truncated record can be missed."},{"id":"p66s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
